-- 2026-11-19: "continue improving smash history in rounds, read liquipedia by hand if it's the best
-- source"). Read by hand in Matthew's Chrome from each tournament's own Liquipedia page (its prize pool
-- table), one page at a time, several seconds apart; each page's 1st and 2nd checked against the names
-- already saved (all 34 agree). Facts only (places and names), credited to Liquipedia (CC-BY-SA); a
-- Brawl-only major's source link now points at its own page. Only fills brackets that still have 2 places
-- or fewer; safe to run twice.

